  Helpful learning resources
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;MDN Web Docs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
